# Aligned to Mob's device OTP runtime tarball (otp-5c9c69fc), which ships
# erts-17.0 (OTP 29). mob_dev's elixir_skew check compares MINOR versions.
# zig is the Android/iOS cross-compiler mob_dev shells out to.
#
# zig was 0.15.2 until 4 September. On macOS 26 (CommandLineTools SDK 27.0)
# 0.15.2 cannot link its own build runner: `zig build` on an EMPTY build.zig
# fails with ~24 undefined libSystem symbols (_malloc, _fork, _dispatch_*,
# std.Build.Watch.FsEvents). Nothing to do with this project. `SDKROOT` is not
# a way out — 0.15.2 emits `-syslibroot .../MacOSX.sdk` regardless of it, and
# the 26.5 and 27.0 SDKs carry identical libSystem.B.tbd target lists anyway.
erlang 29.0.2
elixir 1.20.2-otp-29
zig 0.16.0
